{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24662","headline":"哭刘尚书梦得二首 二 · 白居易","name":"哭刘尚书梦得二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今日哭君吾道孤，寝门泪满白髭须。\n不知箭折弓何用，兼恐唇亡齿亦枯。\n窅窅穷泉埋宝玉，駸駸落景挂桑榆。\n夜台暮齿期非远，但问前头相见无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24662.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24662","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}